# 🚨 Use Case: Emergency Procurement

## 📌 Business Requirement
Urgent purchase without delay.

---

## 🌍 Scenario
Critical item needed immediately.

---

## 🔁 Process Flow
1. PR raised  
2. Fast-track approval  
3. PO created  

---

## ⚙️ System Behavior
- Special approval flow  
- Priority processing  

---

## ⚠️ Challenges
- Bypassing controls  
- Higher cost  

---

## ✅ Solution
- Define emergency policy  
- Monitor usage  

---

## 🎯 Learning
Balance speed with control.
